/*
 * The chrome icons, inlined so they inherit `currentColor` and cost no
 * request.
 *
 * Paths are Octicons 19.32.0 (MIT, GitHub Inc.), copied unmodified from the
 * published set and recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The GitHub mark has to
 * be the real one — an approximation of someone else's trademark is worse than
 * no mark at all — and taking the rest from the same family keeps one drawing
 * hand across the header.
 *
 * These are interface chrome, not diagram grammar. DESIGN.md's material law
 * (open is outlined, opaque is filled) governs what a shape *means* inside a
 * diagram; a theme switch is not making a claim about encryption. The design
 * system owns no icon set today, which is why this file exists here. When it
 * grows one, this is what moves.
 */
export type IconName = 'github' | 'sun' | 'moon' | 'desktop' | 'copy' | 'check';

